## Views interaction
## Test specifically the views menu and its sub-menus

# Main menu -> Views.
EXPECT_WAIT:Main Menu (press [q] to quit):
DOWN
DOWN
ENTER

# Produce the first available view.
EXPECT_WAIT:Main Menu / Views (press [q] to quit):
ENTER
EXPECT_WAIT:Select a view to produce
ENTER

# Go back from produce views
EXPECT_WAIT:Main Menu / Views (press [q] to quit):
ENTER
EXPECT_WAIT:Select a view to produce (press [q] to quit):
DOWN
DOWN
DOWN
DOWN
DOWN
DOWN
DOWN
EXPECT:> Back
ENTER

# View name already exists
EXPECT_WAIT:Main Menu / Views (press [q] to quit):
DOWN
ENTER
EXPECT_WAIT:Enter the name of the new view (or just press Enter to go back):
EXPECT:New View Name>
TEXT:mega
ENTER
EXPECT:A view with the name mega already exists

# Empty equations
EXPECT:New View Name>
TEXT:test
ENTER
EXPECT:New View Equation>
ENTER
EXPECT_WAIT:Main Menu / Views (press [q] to quit):
DOWN
DOWN
DOWN
ENTER
EXPECT_WAIT:Select a view to edit (press [q] to quit):
ENTER
EXPECT:New View Equation>
ENTER
EXPECT_WAIT:Main Menu / Views (press [q] to quit):
DOWN
DOWN
DOWN
ENTER
EXPECT_WAIT:Select a view to edit (press [q] to quit):
ENTER
EXPECT:Any["first_group"]
EXPECT:New View Equation>
ENTER

# Add a view with an initial equation.
